#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:179
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de verificare pentru migrare"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:181
msgid "For a clean port to v4.5.3 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Pentru un port curat la v4.5.3, munca tipică este:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:183
msgid ""
"Stop using ``Image.div()`` / ``cartoon()`` / ``mul()`` (:ref:`the removed "
"methods <v4_5_3_removed>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renunțați la folosirea ``Image.div()`` / ``cartoon()`` / ``mul()`` (\\ "
":ref:`metodele eliminate <v4_5_3_removed>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:185
msgid ""
"Import the display module as :mod:`display` and switch ``dsi_write``/ "
"``dsi_read`` to ``bus_write``/``bus_read`` (:ref:`the display API change "
"<v4_5_3_display>`)."
msgstr ""
"Importați modulul de display ca :mod:`display` și treceți de la "
"``dsi_write``\\ / ``dsi_read`` la ``bus_write``\\ /\\ ``bus_read`` (\\ "
":ref:`modificarea API-ului de display <v4_5_3_display>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:188
msgid ""
"Update ``MQTTClient`` construction (``port`` is required; "
"``ssl_params``/``callback``) and any ``tf.regression()`` calls (:ref:`the "
"library API changes <v4_5_3_libs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Actualizați construcția ``MQTTClient`` (\\ ``port`` este obligatoriu; "
"``ssl_params``\\ /\\ ``callback``\\ ) și orice apeluri ``tf.regression()`` "
"(\\ :ref:`modificările de API ale bibliotecilor <v4_5_3_libs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.3.rst:191
msgid ""
"Pass ``awb()`` ``max`` and ``gamma()`` ``gamma``/``contrast``/ "
"``brightness`` as keyword arguments, and re-check YUV422/transpose and AP-"
